      <agendaitemtitle>Appointment of Chair 2025/26</agendaitemtitle>
      <agendatext>&lt;div class="WordSection1"&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;GMCA Members are required to
note that Andy Burnham, as the Mayor of Greater Manchester, under
Part 5A, section 4 of the Constitution, is the Chair of the GMCA
(ex-officio).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
